    {
      "id": "cc8f16e3",
      "type": "text",
      "position": {
        "x": -904,
        "y": 352
      },
      "data": {
        "html": "<h1>Background</h1><p></p><p>Industrial engineers need to identify anomalous patterns in physical-system data early to prevent equipment failures and reduce operational costs.</p><p></p><p>This need is growing: <mark>the global anomaly detection market is estimated at $7–8B in 2026</mark>, and our team had also received direct requests from our top customers.</p>",
        "size": "xl"
      },
      "width": 600,
      "height": 448
    },
